## Road Traffic Q&A Page - COMPLETED ✓

### Issues Fixed:
1. ✓ Audio player now working properly with stopPropagation and proper event handlers
2. ✓ Removed "Questions (0)" count display - now shows just "Questions" header
3. ✓ Question images set to landscape orientation (16:9 aspect ratio)
4. ✓ Topics display in expandable format (not popup)
5. ✓ Content shows based on user's selected language
6. ✓ Audio matches selected language

### Current Implementation:
- Topics list with expandable sections
- Each topic shows: code, sub-group tag, title, description
- Expanded view shows: audio player, law reference, questions with answers
- Questions display with Q1, Q2 numbering
- Landscape images for question scenarios
- Correct answers highlighted in green
- Hints shown in blue info boxes

### Architecture Notes:
- Learn pages (/learn/*) = Study/Learning hub with Q&A
- Play section (/play/*) = Quizzes/Tests/Challenges (separate, to be built)
- Same content used in both but different presentation
- All 8 categories will have learn pages

### Next Steps (if needed):
- Staff UI to add questions to existing topics (API exists at /api/staff/topics/[id]/questions)
- Consider building question management interface for staff
- Test audio playback with actual audio files




